d><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Hence, we get the solutions <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"80\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle